// NIGHTWARD_BK_CAPTURE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P395529898" "We know you are harboring Black Swan. Tell us where she is and you will recieve a quick death."
// NIGHTWARD_BK_CAPTURE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3332193916" "Tell us, vile creature what you know of the one called Black Swan!"
// NIGHTWARD_BK_CAPTURE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3514395231" "Do you wish to speak up, or shall we begin plucking?"
// NIGHTWARD_BK_CAPTURE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P257369429" "I grow weary of your silent tongue, creature...<em>Men, clip its wings."
// NIGHTWARD_BK_CAPTURE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P237318511" "Perhaps you can take Black Swan's place in the Eternal Prison, hmm..?"
// NIGHTWARD_BK_CAPTURE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2880546704" "Speak the truth, FOUL BEAST, or I shall PLUCK it out of you?"
// NIGHTWARD_BK_CAPTURE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1800095461" "We have ways of making you talk, she-beast...<em>Men, fetch the tar."

// NIGHTWARD_BK_CAPTURE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2962561855" "SPIES!<em>Hunt them down! Let NONE escape!"
// NIGHTWARD_BK_CAPTURE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P609371503" "We have intruders in our midst!"
// NIGHTWARD_BK_CAPTURE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P4020461171" "You do not belong in this realm... YET!"
// NIGHTWARD_BK_CAPTURE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1152094810" "Bring me their heads!"
// NIGHTWARD_BK_CAPTURE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P978422117" "What is the meaning of this intrusion!?"
// NIGHTWARD_BK_CAPTURE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P332248129" "Another intruder!"
// NIGHTWARD_BK_CAPTURE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P4062377988" "You do not belong in this realm!"
// NIGHTWARD_BK_CAPTURE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P4219368913" "I want this one's HEAD on a PIKE!"
// NIGHTWARD_BK_CAPTURE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P4244146548" "I want this one questioned!"

// NIGHTWARD_BK_CAPTURE_ALERTED_MP :
"P1114258481" "You do not belong in this realm... Yet!"

// NIGHTWARD_BK_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3943126714" "Keep your eyes peeled... This was no accident."
// NIGHTWARD_BK_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1481545161" "Look lively... The Talons could be anywhere."
// NIGHTWARD_BK_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2853060103" "Any knight felled by such an inferior creature deserves this fate."
// NIGHTWARD_BK_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4102972867" "I may have underestimated the prowess of these creatures, foolish as they are."
// NIGHTWARD_BK_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2072848390" "The Talons will pay dearly for meddling in our affairs."
// NIGHTWARD_BK_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1725888439" "Any soldier slain by such creatures deserves his fate."

// NIGHTWARD_BK_GUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2447494758" "Our blades shall drink deeply this night!"
// NIGHTWARD_BK_GUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P4027750578" "This one knows something!"
// NIGHTWARD_BK_GUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1730342022" "YOU!"
// NIGHTWARD_BK_GUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2172749069" "I want this one questioned!<em>If it refuses to speak, bring me its head!"

// NIGHTWARD_BK_RALLY_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3768250182" "Attack!"
// NIGHTWARD_BK_RALLY_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1263530397" "Prove your honor, sword brothers, and capture this intruder!<em>You may be redeemed yet!"

// NIGHTWARD_TOV_FIGHT_BK_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P4236900114" "Kill them all! I want their heads on pikes!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_FIGHT_BK_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1904113364" "Follow your blades!"

// NIGHTWARD_BK_Fight_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1032558660" "Vile creatures!<em>Begone from this land and we shall spare your twisted lives!"
// NIGHTWARD_BK_Fight_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3591602690" "Stand aside, she-devils!<em>You are a blight upon this land!"
// NIGHTWARD_BK_Fight_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2240423770" "We know you are here at the behest of Black Swan, she-devils!"
// NIGHTWARD_BK_Fight_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4073039777" "Return at once to the pits from whence you came or we shall send you there by force!"
// NIGHTWARD_BK_Fight_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1760537679" "Continue holding your forked tongues if you so choose.<em>We will gladly remove them for you!"
// NIGHTWARD_BK_Fight_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2363802814" "Speak the truth, wicked ones! Where are you hiding Black Swan!"

// NIGHTWARD_BK_RALLY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3758479446" "SHE is hidden somewhere in this realm, but not for long. We WILL find her and bring her to justice!"
// NIGHTWARD_BK_RALLY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1738734560" "Black Swan MUST be brought to justice!<em>We will show her just how far the Black Knights arms reach!"
// NIGHTWARD_BK_RALLY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3639944945" "You have ALL failed at locating Black Swan.<em>You will be returned to your menial duties at the Eternal Prison on the morrow."
// NIGHTWARD_BK_RALLY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1254736206" "You are knights of the BLACK! There is NO excuse for this delay in locating Black Swan!"
// NIGHTWARD_BK_RALLY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3083405643" "We are The Black Knights! Respected and feared wardens of the nethers!<em>Have your centuries of training amounted to nothing??"

// NIGHTWARD_BK_LOITER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3967841694" "Prove your loyalty and bring me this one's head!"
// NIGHTWARD_BK_LOITER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3769750533" "Spies!<em>Hunt them down! Let NONE escape!"
// NIGHTWARD_BK_LOITER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3320257038" "Prove your honor, sword brothers, and capture this intruder!"
// NIGHTWARD_BK_LOITER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1561810450" "Trust in your steel, sword brothers!"
// NIGHTWARD_BK_LOITER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P785911620" "Follow your steel, sword brothers! Let it guide you to this one's throat!"
// NIGHTWARD_BK_LOITER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P4288770242" "FOOL! Death is now your only salvation!"
// NIGHTWARD_BK_LOITER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P76344695" "Sword brothers! Our blades shall drink deeply this night!"
// NIGHTWARD_BK_LOITER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3266654959" "Move in! Strike down anything that bleeds!"

// NIGHTWARD_BK_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3209948391" "I have heard murmurs around camp... The men are growing restless."
// NIGHTWARD_BK_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3080201286" "Nearly half of the guards we dispatch fail to ever return."
// NIGHTWARD_BK_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P423713650" "We will need to send for more men soon."
// NIGHTWARD_BK_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1674685300" "The Talons are no doubt behind Black Swan's refuge in this land."
// NIGHTWARD_BK_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3404817034" "While admittedly dangerous, our mission here is a welcome break from the monotony of the prison."
// NIGHTWARD_BK_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P795604295" "Our next plan of attack will be decided in the coming days.<em>Until then I trust you and your men will remain vigilant."
// NIGHTWARD_BK_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3196945136" "Thus far we have dismissed the notion that the Talons pose any real threat to our mission."
// NIGHTWARD_BK_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3695258404" "We are limited in resources and our brothers are growing restless.<em>I fear some may defect if we do not change tactics soon."

// NIGHTWARD_BK_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P870423383" "Look lively, men.<em>Something is coming..."

// NIGHTWARD_BK_PATROL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1159577723" "Fall in, men! Our blades shall drink deeply this night!"
// NIGHTWARD_BK_PATROL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2408465503" "Strike down anything that bleeds!"

// NIGHTWARD_BK_FIGHT_TOV_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P207558945" "Fall in, men! Strike down anything that bleeds!"
// NIGHTWARD_BK_FIGHT_TOV_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1792601644" "Fall in, men! These devils have summoned minions!"

// NIGHTWARD_TOV_FIGHT_BK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2933770705" "Sheathe your swords, gentlemen! We know nothing of this... Black Swan, is it?"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_FIGHT_BK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2937850247" "So... you've come to Night Ward in search of Black Swan? ...and in such a late hour.<em>Too little, too late. The trail's run cold."
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_FIGHT_BK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4163159788" "Stand aside, lumbering oafs! We'll not have you getin the way of our ambitions in this land!"

// NIGHTWARD_BK_FIGHT_APP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1125541326" "Stand your ground, men! We do not fully know what these things are capable of."
// NIGHTWARD_BK_FIGHT_APP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3016812643" "These things breathe only hate and understand only death. Let us speak to them in their words!"
// NIGHTWARD_BK_FIGHT_APP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3363461625" "Stand aside, restless spirits! We will not hesitate to send you back into oblivion!"

// NIGHTWARD_BK_FIGHT_APP_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1150210404" "Let us send these things back to hell!"
// NIGHTWARD_BK_FIGHT_APP_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3569749977" "Fall in!"

// NIGHTWARD_BK_SIT_CAMP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3063366237" "Look lively, men.<em>I sense something is coming..."

// NIGHTWARD_BK_SIT_CAMP_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1191480325" "Fall in, sword brothers! Our blades shall drink deeply this night!"

// NIGHTWARD_BK_INFANTRY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1649740910" "The Talons would be wise to fear our steel."
// NIGHTWARD_BK_INFANTRY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1539576165" "Look lively, sword brothers...<em>I sense something is coming."
// NIGHTWARD_BK_INFANTRY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2067735657" "Damned Swan... Dragging us out here so we can be picked off by those she-devils."
// NIGHTWARD_BK_INFANTRY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1585289107" "I should be back at my watch. Not standing around in this forsaken place."
// NIGHTWARD_BK_INFANTRY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2208157975" "If the patrols do not find Black Swan soon, I will hunt her down myself."
// NIGHTWARD_BK_INFANTRY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2152726715" "Wretched she-devils.<em>They have us surrounded, yet no one seems to take notice."
// NIGHTWARD_BK_INFANTRY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P175362553" "I will be damned if the captain thinks he can keep me from seeing any action in this place."
// NIGHTWARD_BK_INFANTRY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1900248585" "When is the next rotation?<em>...been standing here for days."
// NIGHTWARD_BK_INFANTRY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P608761436" "I WISH the Talons would storm our camp.<em>...perhaps they are not as stupid as I had hoped."

// NIGHTWARD_BK_INFANTRY_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P409117264" "Your bravery will not go unrewarded, mortal!<em>I will grant you a clean death!"
// NIGHTWARD_BK_INFANTRY_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1638729341" "THIS is what we have trained for, sword brothers! Follow your steel!"

// NIGHTWARD_BK_ARCHERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P549409173" "The Talons would be wise to fear our arrows."
// NIGHTWARD_BK_ARCHERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4152242700" "God's know none can escape my sights. And yet, they continue to test me."
// NIGHTWARD_BK_ARCHERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1941542585" "Despite all it's beauty, how I loathe this land."
// NIGHTWARD_BK_ARCHERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2730916034" "This land... It changes a man."
// NIGHTWARD_BK_ARCHERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1041833039" "We have endured far too much to lose heart now."
// NIGHTWARD_BK_ARCHERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P413962130" "Nothing here that I had not seen already in the prison."
// NIGHTWARD_BK_ARCHERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2459761134" "Yes. I have seen them too... Apparitions, they are called."
// NIGHTWARD_BK_ARCHERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P180657427" "Devilish spirits... Forsaken to wander this limbo for all of eternity."
// NIGHTWARD_BK_ARCHERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P403557289" "You would do well to keep a vigilant eye on those devils..."

// NIGHTWARD_BK_ARCHERS_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1195126636" "THIS is what we have trained for, sword brothers! Let us rain DEATH upon them!"
// NIGHTWARD_BK_ARCHERS_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P727725060" "Loose your arrows, men!<em>Pin him to the ground!"
// NIGHTWARD_BK_ARCHERS_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P379752633" "I want this one nailed to the ground!"
// NIGHTWARD_BK_ARCHERS_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2689645993" "There! He must NOT escape!"
// NIGHTWARD_BK_ARCHERS_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1596134826" "No mortal can evade our arrows!<em>Spare us this hunt and accept your fate!"

